    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651490/extras/5663f4dcbc714069d19bddaff9639068.avif?t=1747205888\" width=800 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651490/extras/8d79e8bce3a521e336af190b383119ec.poster.avif?t=1747205888\" width=676 height=179 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651490/extras/8d79e8bce3a521e336af190b383119ec.webm?t=1747205888\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Forge your Strategy\u00a0- </strong>Choose from over <strong>200+</strong> Augments to improve your campfire's abilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unleash new Powers\u00a0</strong>- Unlock new <strong>Effects</strong> that significantly change how you battle during the night</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endure until Morning </strong>- Adapt your build and survive relentless waves of enemies until 6 AM</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651490/extras/56329bde8c8644a3a5569fa568b6cfac.poster.avif?t=1747205888\" width=529 height=273 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651490/extras/56329bde8c8644a3a5569fa568b6cfac.webm?t=1747205888\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><