mai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651490/extras/2269aa6002339cce290eea007a2c59ac.poster.avif?t=1747205888\" width=553 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651490/extras/2269aa6002339cce290eea007a2c59ac.webm?t=1747205888\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651490/extras/0c86452b3f517e6e33e003dd2de331a6.avif?t=1747205888\" width=800 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Forge new Friendships</strong> - Socialize with other campers to discover new ways to strengthen your campfire</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Become a Wildlife Specialist</strong> - Register all of the 60+ Species in\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651490/extras/401908f6e7dd8ed66b2c502cc0747a51.webp?t=1747205888\" width=32 height=28 /></span>\u00a0<strong>Betsy's Bestiary </strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Haggle for Treasure</strong> - Strike deals for precious items and upgrades in\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651490/extras/f7104513b9924a4cb16f2d0daeb85b0b.webp?t=1747205888\" width=32 height=28 /></span><strong>Naal's Black Market </strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unwind at the Campsite</strong> - Experience the camping life and enjoy the calm moments between battles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Leisure Time </strong>- Go to\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651490/extras/679def846104a3f95a9ef011ffca34f4.webp?t=1747205888\" width=32 height=28 /></span><strong>Gyomyo's Casino</strong> and enjoy a collection of mini-games of all sorts</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651490/extras/c925dc1ae82012b57c4ee4bdf59ac63f.poster.avif?t=1747205888\" width=622 height=258 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651490/extras/c925dc1ae82012b57c4ee4bdf59ac63f.webm?t=1747205888\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
